{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109165053743-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109165936\"/><p>事主送院搶救後不治。</p><p>今日(9日)中午12時03分，荃灣大帽山有市民報案，指一名姓楊(48歲)男子，獨自在大帽山道上址行山期間胸口痛。政府飛行服務隊直升機奉召飛臨現場上空，並把楊男吊起，惟他已經陷入昏迷狀態，被送往東區醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。案件列作「送院時死亡」跟進，楊男死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.038615+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:50:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:18.053409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.588374+00:00","content_hash":"63bcee53615affe770c1345e98bc4715db35f61a9f2bb9d2573a4ecc95c41aa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.038615+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}